        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "```json\n{\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Anti-Assignment\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"The License Rights are exclusive to Berkshire and may not be assigned or in any way conveyed by Berkshire without Auriemma's  express written consent, except in the event of a merger by Berkshire with another entity offering Banking Services.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"except in the event of a merger by Berkshire with another entity offering Banking Services.\",\n      \"note\": \"While assignments by Berkshire generally require written consent, Section 2(c) permits assignment of License Rights without consent in the event of a merger with another entity offering Banking Services, and Section 22 permits Auriemma to assign monetary benefits.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Change Of Control\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"Continuity of Ownership. For the purposes of this Agreement, a transaction in which the ultimate beneficial ownership of a party remains substantially unchanged, including any internal reorganisation, recapitalisation, or transaction effected solely to alter the jurisdiction of incorporation of that party, does not constitute a change of control, an acquisition, or a transfer of control of that party. The rights and obligations arising under this Agreement upon a change of control have no application to any such transaction.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"a transaction in which the ultimate beneficial ownership of a party remains substantially unchanged, including any internal reorganisation, recapitalisation, or transaction effected solely to alter the jurisdiction of incorporation of that party, does not constitute a change of control, an acquisition, or a transfer of control of that party.\",\n      \"note\": \"The contract provides that change of control provisions do not apply to internal reorganisations, recapitalisations, or transactions where ultimate beneficial ownership remains substantially unchanged.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Exclusivity\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"Auriemma will not enter into any arrangement or agreement, which enables any Berkshire Competitor to be endorsed by Auriemma  (whether by using the Auriemma Identification, Auriemma providing services similar to the Endorsement Services, or otherwise) during the  Contract Period within the Contract Territory.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"Notwithstanding the foregoing, it is understood that Auriemma has no control or influence over any  decisions by the University of Connecticut to enter into any arrangement or agreement with any Berkshire Competitor.\",\n      \"note\": \"Auriemma agrees to exclusivity preventing endorsement of competitors, but the clause expressly qualifies this by acknowledging Auriemma has no control over decisions by the University of Connecticut to contract with competitors.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
